{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadow of Dutch colonial rule in 1860s Java, a once-peaceful warrior, Barda Mandrawata, is thrust into darkness after a tragic event takes the life of his loved one. Swearing vengeance, Barda embarks on a perilous journey across war-torn lands, haunted jungles, and ancient ruins to hunt down those responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trained in a cave by an ancient spirit, Barda loses his sight but gains mystical skills and enhances his remaining senses. Along the way, he encounters rebels, mystics, and oppressed villagers\u2014each holding pieces of a greater conspiracy tied to both colonial forces and a supernatural legend buried deep in Java\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As his legend grows, Barda becomes The Blind Warrior\u2014a symbol of resistance and a silent force against tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features brutal combat with melee and hand-to-hand fighting, including mixed combos, blocks, parries, stealth, and stealth kills. Combined with a unique visual system representing blind senses, players can scan the environment to detect enemies and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.poster.avif?t=1767455907\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.webm?t=1767455907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.mp4?t=1767455907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821910?t=1767455907","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/90baa26f624c30159f186970719132fff85e6bbb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767455907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/94b6f6ab09d7d48531e1d8fa0e769422021a316c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767455907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/94b6f6ab09d7d48531e1d8fa0e769422021a316c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767455907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence or depictions of combat"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadow of Dutch colonial rule in 1860s Java, a once-peaceful warrior, Barda Mandrawata, is thrust into darkness after a tragic event takes the life of his loved one. Swearing vengeance, Barda embarks on a perilous journey across war-torn lands, haunted jungles, and ancient ruins to hunt down those responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trained in a cave by an ancient spirit, Barda loses his sight but gains mystical skills and enhances his remaining senses. Along the way, he encounters rebels, mystics, and oppressed villagers\u2014each holding pieces of a greater conspiracy tied to both colonial forces and a supernatural legend buried deep in Java\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As his legend grows, Barda becomes The Blind Warrior\u2014a symbol of resistance and a silent force against tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features brutal combat with melee and hand-to-hand fighting, including mixed combos, blocks, parries, stealth, and stealth kills. Combined with a unique visual system representing blind senses, players can scan the environment to detect enemies and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.poster.avif?t=1767455907\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.webm?t=1767455907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.mp4?t=1767455907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rizero Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/4e18ddc92f94c128c0f4214fcd5b856ad1f87af3/header.jpg?t=1767455907","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/382